{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284270","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028427001:0":{"text":"그래, 이게 당신의 본모습이었군. 당신은 식물학자가 아니었어!","source_cn":"好呀，原来这才是你的真面目，你根本不是植物学家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23C01C5DAC81977A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028427002:0":{"text":"...나쁜 놈아!","source_cn":"——坏人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135E55DF75DB5A1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028427003:0":{"text":"이제 진실을 말하세요!","source_cn":"先生，你现在可以说实话了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4EDBB726B08ADD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028427004:0":{"text":"나, 난 블랙골드 상회 사람이야... 때리지 마. 자, 이건 식물학자를 깨울 수 있는 해독약이라고! 여기!","source_cn":"我、我是黑金商会的……别动手，给，这是能让那个植物学家...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF023DB791FAEA892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028427005:0":{"text":"내가 저 사람의 아이를 납치해서 나에게 협조하라고 협박했어...","source_cn":"我带走了他的孩子，胁迫他和我合作……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x942396AD8643E716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1028427005":{"text":"내가 저 사람의 아이를 납치해서 나에게 협조하라고 협박했어...","source_cn":"我带走了他的孩子，胁迫他和我合作……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x942396AD8643E716","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028427006:0":{"text":"가둬놨어... 아이가 있는 곳을 알려줄게! 제발 때, 때리지 마!","source_cn":"我把他的孩子关起来了……我会把地方告诉你们！别、别打！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43C0052AC5875C92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028427007:0":{"text":"여기서 대체 뭘 하고 있었죠?!","source_cn":"你们到底在这里做什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEEEFD55366C34C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028427008:0":{"text":"연, 연구... 부패에 관련된 연구를...","source_cn":"做、做研究……腐化的研究……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE96396D7236B900B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1028427008":{"text":"연, 연구... 부패에 관련된 연구를...","source_cn":"做、做研究……腐化的研究……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE96396D7236B900B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028427009:0":{"text":"맞아. 그렇게 외진 곳에 갑자기 사람들이 잔뜩 올 줄 누가 알았겠어...","source_cn":"是我，谁知道那么偏僻的地方，突然来了一队人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2C836A0D58A1B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028427013:0":{"text":"안 되겠어요! 이런 인간은 절대 놔줄 수 없어요! 마스터, 우리 저 사람을...","source_cn":"不行！不能放过他！主人，我们干脆把他——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6B48E85425A25379","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"안 되겠어요! 이런 인간은 절대 놔줄 수 없어요! 마스터, 우리 저 사람을...","female":"안 되겠어요! 이런 인간은 절대 놔줄 수 없어요! 마스터, 우리 저 사람을...","variant_male_record_index":"113335","variant_female_record_index":"113336","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028427014:0":{"text":"어? 하... 하지 마... 내가 다 말했잖아! 말했잖아! 살려줘! 제발!","source_cn":"哎？别……别别……我、我都说了，都说了啊！救命！求求你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EFBCB35958C0E7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028427015:0":{"text":"... 저 사람을 묶어서 순찰대에게 넘겨요!","source_cn":"——把他绑起来！叫巡游队把他带走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD943611C04229F34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028427016:0":{"text":"흥! 치피 화났어!","source_cn":"哼！气死满满了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9460F10A82F40B60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028427017:1":{"text":"순찰대가 합당한 처분을 내릴 거예요. 우린 우선 이 진짜 식물학자를 구하도록 해요.","source_cn":"巡游队会给他应有的待遇，我们先把那位真正的植物学家救醒吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2769C0FCB4DD553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"벌목장의 부패는 네가 한 짓이었군","source_cn":"林场的腐化是你做的吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCBF65DF1DE8A1F7E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"벌목장의 부패는 네가 한 짓이었군","female":"벌목장의 부패는 네가 한 짓이었군","variant_male_record_index":"61880","variant_female_record_index":"61881","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028427010:0":{"text":"연구를 하려면 숲의 부패뿐만 아니라 현지 생물의 부패 잠식 상태도 연구해야 하거든...","source_cn":"研究嘛，除了研究森林腐化，当然也要研究当地生物被腐化侵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA15EFECF9603FEFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028427011:0":{"text":"어쨌든 때마침 채집대가 왔잖아... 그리고 병세가 그렇게 심각한 것도 아니었고...","source_cn":"这不刚好那些采集队来了……而且，事实上也没有造成很严重...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FFE371EF57D2DFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028427012:0":{"text":"어떻게 인간이 그런 짓을 할 수 있죠!","source_cn":"你！你简直毫无人性！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD558D694BC1F215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"채집대의 병은...","source_cn":"采集队的病情……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x327E3E0C3560C2C5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"채집대의 병은...","female":"채집대의 병은...","variant_male_record_index":"61882","variant_female_record_index":"61883","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"아이는 어디 있지?","source_cn":"说，他的孩子在哪里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC61B741B5A11497A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아이는 어디 있지?","female":"아이는 어디 있지?","variant_male_record_index":"61876","variant_female_record_index":"61877","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"어린아이를 볼모로 삼다니!","source_cn":"竟然用小孩子做威胁！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x453F54665505612F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어린아이를 볼모로 삼다니!","female":"어린아이를 볼모로 삼다니!","variant_male_record_index":"61878","variant_female_record_index":"61879","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:“黑金学者”瓦西里":{"text":"“블랙골드 학자” 바실리에","source":"“黑金学者”瓦西里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":4}}